# sillytavern-launcher
===
 SillyTavern Launcher is a launcher designed specifically for SillyTavern, easily managing SillyTavern on all platforms and offering a desktop version. It primarily supports Windows. Availability on other platforms is uncertain due to the lack of a testing platform.
